1
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:11,150
Based on lesson content and words learned, tell main content of reading.

2
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:19,020
1. Essay describes what in Ca Mau?

3
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:26,840
A. Rain, sun phenomenon in Ca Mau.

4
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:32,970
B. Trees in Ca Mau.

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:39,950
C. Nature and people of Ca Mau.

6
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:46,550
Answer C

7
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:54,310
Ca Mau is rainy monsoon land.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:02,330
In March, April, when sunny, suddenly rain pours down right there.

9
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:12,420
Heavy rain pours for a while then clears. In rain often whirlwind rises.

10
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:19,440
What is special about Ca Mau rain?

11
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:31,600
Ca Mau rain is very sudden violent whirlwind rain but clears quickly.

12
00:01:33,530 --> 00:01:43,480
On this land, lone trees can hardly withstand sky's anger.

13
00:01:44,110 --> 00:01:59,860
Barringtonia and fuchsia must grow in bunches; roots must be long, must be planted deep in ground.

14
00:02:01,130 --> 00:02:11,420
Most is mangrove. Mangrove grows densely.

15
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:21,240
Houses built along canal banks, under rows of green mangroves.

16
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:32,750
From this house to that house must climb bridge made of mangrove trunk...

17
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:40,460
Which tree has most in Ca Mau?

18
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:49,200
A. Barringtonia

19
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:55,640
B. fuchsia

20
00:02:56,260 --> 00:03:04,400
C. mangrove

21
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:11,370
Answer C

22
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:19,970
How do Ca Mau trees grow?

23
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:26,000
You observe answer.

24
00:03:28,350 --> 00:03:44,950
Barringtonia and fuchsia must grow in bunches; roots must be long, must be planted deep in ground.

25
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:54,930
Mangrove trees grow densely.

26
00:03:55,880 --> 00:04:03,000
In Ca Mau houses are built where?

27
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:11,480
Choose suitable word to fill blank.

28
00:04:12,550 --> 00:04:20,420
A. Barringtonia

29
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:27,240
B. fuchsia

30
00:04:27,970 --> 00:04:35,970
C. mangrove row

31
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:42,020
Answer C

32
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:52,000
In Ca Mau, how does one house go to another house?

33
00:04:53,820 --> 00:05:00,970
Choose suitable word to fill blank.

34
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:10,480
A. mangrove trunk

35
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:19,020
B. fuchsia trunk

36
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:30,240
C. Barringtonia trunk

37
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:37,000
Answer A

38
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:45,510
Living in Ca Mau, people must be resourceful.

39
00:05:46,460 --> 00:06:01,130
Ancestral martial spirit passed down to develop and protect this tip of Fatherland.

40
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:09,000
State Ca Mau people's characteristics.

41
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:23,000
Ca Mau people are resourceful, carry ancestral martial spirit.

